{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712430/extras/logo_text.png?t=1746939577\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Sandbox Adventure Vehicle building game, Where you the player are tasked to collect resources from a Moon planet then get back home, Or with sandbox mode build anything your heart desires.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712430/extras/BUILDING.png?t=1746939577\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712430/extras/2025-05-0703-08-18-ezgif.com-crop.gif?t=1746939577\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Carbrix uses a Very simple building system</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Allowing you to build what you want, Almost how you want.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With Carbrix you can build, Cars Bikes Planes And whatever comes to mind!!!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With a simple to access anytime Buildmenu Stop Fix and GO!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And when you're done, just save it and spawn it again anytime.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712430/extras/SANDBOX.png?t=1746939577\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712430/extras/2025-05-0703-16-57-ezgif.com-crop.gif?t=1746939577\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Carbrix has a Super fun SandBox mode</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In SandBox mode, you have access to all the blocks in the game with endless possibilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make whatever you have been thinking, dreaming or wondering about!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play on flatmap And do mini Quests!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With SandBox what Can't you do?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3712430?t=1746939577","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3712430?t=1746939577","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712430/720986adfa5c03af425f0ec2cccba151f82dd668/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746939577","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712430/720986adfa5c03af425f0ec2cccba151f82dd668/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746939577","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712430/extras/logo_text.png?t=1746939577\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Sandbox Adventure Vehicle building game, Where you the player are tasked to collect resources from a Moon planet then get back home, Or with sandbox mode build anything your heart desires.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712430/extras/BUILDING.png?t=1746939577\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712430/extras/2025-05-0703-08-18-ezgif.com-crop.gif?t=1746939577\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Carbrix uses a Very simple building system</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Allowing you to build what you want, Almost how you want.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With Carbrix you can build, Cars Bikes Planes And whatever comes to mind!!!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With a simple to access anytime Buildmenu Stop Fix and GO!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And when you're done, just save it and spawn it again anytime.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712430/extras/SANDBOX.png?t=1746939577\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712430/extras/2025-05-0703-16-57-ezgif.com-crop.gif?t=1746939577\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Carbrix has a Super fun SandBox mode</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In SandBox mode, you have access to all the blocks in the game with endless possibilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make whatever you have been thinking, dreaming or wondering about!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play on flatmap And do mini Quests!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With SandBox what Can't you do?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Redston4D"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712430/f1460c251fc16dd130d4e9b427b2105d4074484d/header.jpg?t=1746939577","is_free":false,"lin